    intro: 'Exercise, reading, tidying, planning, and journaling stick differently depending on personality preferences. This page maps each MBTI type to habits, exercise styles, and patterns that may feel unnecessarily draining.',
    conceptTitle: 'How the recommendations are framed',
    concepts: [
      { title: 'Energy direction', body: 'Some types sustain habits privately; others need people, visibility, or shared momentum.' },
      { title: 'Stimulation level', body: 'A steady repeatable loop fits some people, while novelty and variation keep others engaged.' },
      { title: 'Reward style', body: 'Data, achievement, meaning, fun, and connection motivate different types in different ways.' },
    ],
    useTitle: 'How to use the guide',
    useCases: [
      { title: 'Choose exercise', body: 'Start with conditions: solo or social, competitive or experiential, tracked or intuitive.' },
